# One line ending everywhere.
#
# This repository lived with `core.autocrlf=true` and no attributes: the index held LF while a
# Windows checkout wrote CRLF back into the working tree. That made two things unpredictable —
# an edit could show up as a whole-file diff after a checkout, and the CRLF in a 264 KB client
# bundle broke multi-line string anchors in scripts. Declaring the rule here means the index and
# every checkout agree, on every platform, regardless of a machine's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
